<section class="ds-s ds-tr"><div class="ds-w ds-tr-h"><div><p class="ds-ey">The dessert trolley</p><h2 class="rv">Made ahead, served with ease</h2></div><p class="ds-p">Drag to browse</p></div><div class="hs ds-hs"><figure class="ds-tp"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1792862242002-40af9499b301?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="a creme caramel with a caramel shard on a white plate" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Cr&egrave;me caramel</b><span>Make the day before</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="ds-tp"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1673551494277-92204546b504?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="chocolate mousse in a white ramekin with raspberries" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Chocolate pots</b><span>Three hours to set</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="ds-tp"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542116021-0ff087fb0a41?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="a panna cotta with strawberry sauce and mint" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Panna cotta</b><span>Four hours to set</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="ds-tp"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541781550486-81b7a2328578?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="a small lemon meringue tart on slate with a spoon" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Lemon tart</b><span>Bake in the morning</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="ds-tp"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1624300603538-1207400f4116?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="a tall pavlova topped with fruit on a cake stand" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Pavlova</b><span>Top at the last minute</span></figcaption></figure></div></section>

<section class="ds-lay"><div class="ds-ly ly1 rv"><div class="ds-w"><b>Crisp</b><p>A tuile, a crumb or a shard of caramel, for contrast in every spoonful.</p></div></div><div class="ds-ly ly2 rv"><div class="ds-w"><b>Creamy</b><p>Custard, mousse, set cream or ice cream: the soft heart of the plate.</p></div></div><div class="ds-ly ly3 rv"><div class="ds-w"><b>Fresh</b><p>Fruit, a sharp sauce or a few herbs to lift the sweetness.</p></div></div></section>

